<title>HONG KONG: HK sees HK$58.9 bln budget surplus 1998-2001-Tsang.</title>
<headline>HK sees HK$58.9 bln budget surplus 1998-2001-Tsang.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said on Wednesday the territory is expected to report a budget surplus of HK$58.9 billion from fiscal year 1998/99 to 2000/01 (April-March).</p>
</text>
